{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：17:10 2026-11-25 HKT<br/>發佈時間：17:10 2026-11-25 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：17:10 2026-11-25 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/3baccacd65a6a5df914248576e6b2874/2026-11/NK261124HKE02_2.jpg\"/><p>港燈今日(25日)宣布調低燃料調整費，由11月的每度55.1仙減至52.3仙。</p><p>港燈指，燃料調整費會按月調整，以適時反映發電燃料成本的變動，12月燃料調整費繼續向下調整，減2.8仙，這是港燈連續第3個月向下調低。<br/> </p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T10:03:51.991243+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":189,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T09:10:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T16:19:29.379860+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T09:57:19.780885+00:00","content_hash":"2cd9bd71b670fdb25f57e779e581efbb83bcbf660e17c6095c01355a52d45d32","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}